g they are not bulky.\",\"but I probably wouldn’t put anything in them. Made more for looks or your hands.\",\"! Nice and flowy. I am 5’8”, 175lbs and ordered a large.\"]},{\"tag\":\"soft material\",\"mentions\":36,\"positive\":33,\"negative\":3,\"snippets\":[\"This is a nice, simple dress for spring, summer & the fall. It’s\",\"& comfortable & it flows nicely. And, I was told it’s nice to have pockets....\",\", light, and not see through. The colors and style is just as advertised....\",\". I saw some reviews saying it was see through but,mine wasn't. I ordered the tie dye. I would say it's true to size....\"]},{\"tag\":\"color\",\"mentions\":26,\"positive\":23,\"negative\":3,\"snippets\":[\"Customers like the colors of the dress, with one mentioning that the color holds up very well.\",\", and the material is soft and flowy. Love the pockets too!...\",\"and I love the way it fit the pockets made it 10 times better to be able to carry...\",\"and how comfortable she is. It has pockets too! Big plus for her.\"]},{\"tag\":\"fabric quality\",\"mentions\":59,\"positive\":37,\"negative\":22,\"snippets\":[\"Customers have mixed opinions about the dress's fabric quality, with some finding it good and noting its medium thickness, while others describe it as terrible, thin, and rough.\",\". Bit of substance to it. Not too short. Nice flare so not clinging to tummy!....\",\", fitting, and color are great, and I love it. Since it's a summer dress, I like it loose, and I ordered one size up, and I'm glad I did....\"]}]"
